ight)+\\left(0\\right)\\cdot\\left(2 \\pi \\cos{\\left(2 \\pi t \\right)}\\right) \\\\ & =\\left(360 t^{4} - 540 t^{3} + 180 t^{2}\\right)+\\left(0\\right)+\\left(0\\right) \\\\ & =\\left(12 t - 6\\right) \\left(30 t^{3} - 30 t^{2}\\right)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we evaluate the integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Γ=\\oint_C F\\cdot\\mathrm dr & =\\int_{0}^{1}F(r(t))\\cdot r^{\\prime}(t)\\,\\mathrm dt \\\\ & =\\int_{0}^{1}\\left(\\left(12 t - 6\\right) \\left(30 t^{3} - 30 t^{2}\\right)\\right)\\,\\mathrm dt \\\\ & =\\left[72 t^{5} - 135 t^{4} + 60 t^{3}\\right]_{0}^{1} \\\\ & =[\\left(60\\right)+\\left(-135\\right)+\\left(72\\right)]-[\\left(0\\right)+\\left(0\\right)+\\left(0\\right)] \\\\ & =-3\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535999 17592186045443 true] [17592186554914 1168 "generate/scratch/17592186133926.py" 13194139535999 17592186045443 true] [17592186554914 1169 #uuid "c3c4b7ba-f69a-55fc-8713-34995bc1ce9b" 13194139535999 17592186045443 true]] :edb/tempids {"0107db86-5f81-5e7a-90b1-ac80539a2cab" 17592186554851 "0d5efd9d-3e69-5f74-9f3d-3ac7e3057828" 17592186554852 "0de1e67b-08b0-590a-987d-98f0797e3256" 17592186554853 "114cd428-9ff5-5378-aaf6-79f85ced9209" 17592186554854 "16a69a5b-1a25-591c-a7b0-93d8b7f7c7fb" 17592186554855 "18dd15e6-ceda-574e-ae06-3f078dde4884" 17592186554856 "18df830f-ab86-5425-9738-33adc7144a61" 17592186554857 "1ec2ef2e-3a51-5ca5-b6b9-538fa415f571" 17592186554858 "2412e38f-65d0-568d-9f2c-e830bb205b72" 17592186554859 "2b337fa7-bd8b-5c90-a0a9-70650e2fdcbb" 17592186554860 "2d9fb833-3125-5919-b437-36a3f7f5f96f" 17592186554861 "32b499d6-e35b-5df6-b9cc-4a94b51e5a0c" 17592186554862 "348e1450-060b-511e-ab1c-9ac3626ec2eb" 17592186554863 "38d9f40b-294c-5d0d-b920-423d8a07b7b0" 17592186554864 "4133c25f-bd85-507a-8e90-bf61f17f7c85" 17592186554865 "46488809-31b0-5e06-a0e3-3b15d04132fc" 17592186554866 "551d4d7b-a286-5922-9bb8-28fd2d1e93e0" 17592186554867 "5603107d-9563-57f2-ba74-697614f507d7" 17592186554868 "563b3666-11ab-5f91-bf53-b00d149971a1" 17